              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyakasi ŋakiro ŋace ŋuna alalak ŋuna abu Yesu kitiya, ŋuna ani kerae kigiritetei daadaŋ a ŋapeipei, atami ayoŋ atemar kemam neni kiwuakina ŋikitaaboi anakwap a daadaŋ.",
